# Repository-wide eol rules: this repo runs Linux containers from working-tree
# mounts on Windows clones, so shell scripts must never carry CRLF (a CRLF
# shebang fails with "/bin/sh^M: bad interpreter") and psql scripts with `\ir`
# commands must retain LF for portable bundle execution.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.psql text eol=lf
